flowchart TD
  accTitle: NutsNews infrastructure merge sequence
  accDescr: Four July 30 merges restore an auto-idled staging Access verifier, select a production VPS image, and constrain public health identity during a cache transition. Execution outcomes are not established by the merges.
  A["PR 441: staging deploy\nverify retained root-owned Access files"] --> B["Start existing staging Access Compose project\nwait up to 60 seconds for healthy verifier"]
  B --> C["Live boundary verification\nunsafe files, Compose failure, or unhealthy status fail closed"]
  D["PR 442: production VPS inventory\nselect source, immutable image, build, and generation"] --> E["PR 443: health identity split\nhealth vps; runtime checks production-vps"]
  E --> F["PR 444: cache transition\nhealth accepts only vps or production-vps\nheader must match response body"]
  C --> G["Boundary\nmerge evidence does not establish deployment, migration,\nconfiguration application, compatibility, security, or rollback execution"]
  F --> G
